MODULE catalog

FUNCTION load catalog directory
    read JSON files in stable filename order
    strictly decode and validate every package manifest
    require each filename to match its package name
    reject duplicates and an empty catalog
    return packages indexed by name

FUNCTION load named profile
    validate the requested identifier
    strictly decode its matching profile file
    require profile name and filename to match

FUNCTION validate package or profile
    enforce every schema, identifier, description, license, URL, checksum,
        platform, format, size, path, executable, and uniqueness rule in SPEC.md

FUNCTION resolve lock for profile and platform
    validate the profile and host platform
    visit each requested package depth-first
    reject missing dependencies and cycles
    place dependencies before dependents
    require exactly one asset per selected package for the platform
    return an immutable lock with UTC generation time and ordered packages
